{"seq":1,"slug":"asyncapi-contract-governance","title":"AsyncAPI 契约治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations/asyncapi-contract-governance","wordCount":1134,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"asyncapi-契约治理\">AsyncAPI 契约治理</h1><p>REST API 有 OpenAPI（Swagger）定义接口契约，但事件驱动的异步 API 长期缺乏等价的标准化文档方案——团队用 Confluence 页面、Slack 消息、甚至代码注释来描述事件格式。AsyncAPI 3.x 填补了这个空白：它为异步消息流提供了机器可读的规范，支持从文档生成代码、从代码生成文档、在 CI/CD 中做契约验证。2026 年 AsyncAPI 3.1.0 已成为事件驱动 API 治理的行业标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AsyncAPI 的对象模型与 OpenAPI 同构但语义不同：OpenAPI 描述的是「请求-响应端点」，AsyncAPI 描述的是「异步消息通道」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    SPEC[AsyncAPI 3.1 Document]&#10;    SPEC --&gt; INFO[Info&lt;br/&gt;标题/版本/描述]&#10;    SPEC --&gt; SERVERS[Servers&lt;br/&gt;Kafka/NATS/MQTT 连接信息]&#10;    SPEC --&gt; CHANNELS[Channels&lt;br/&gt;Topic/Queue/Subject 定义]&#10;    SPEC --&gt; OPERATIONS[Operations&lt;br/&gt;send/receive 操作]&#10;    SPEC --&gt; COMPONENTS[Components&lt;br/&gt;可复用 Message/Schema]&#10;    CHANNELS --&gt; MSGS[Messages&lt;br/&gt;消息格式定义]&#10;    MSGS --&gt; PAYLOAD[Payload Schema&lt;br/&gt;JSON Schema / Avro / Protobuf]\">flowchart TB\n    SPEC[AsyncAPI 3.1 Document]\n    SPEC --&gt; INFO[Info&lt;br/&gt;标题/版本/描述]\n    SPEC --&gt; SERVERS[Servers&lt;br/&gt;Kafka/NATS/MQTT 连接信息]\n    SPEC --&gt; CHANNELS[Channels&lt;br/&gt;Topic/Queue/Subject 定义]\n    SPEC --&gt; OPERATIONS[Operations&lt;br/&gt;send/receive 操作]\n    SPEC --&gt; COMPONENTS[Components&lt;br/&gt;可复用 Message/Schema]\n    CHANNELS --&gt; MSGS[Messages&lt;br/&gt;消息格式定义]\n    MSGS --&gt; PAYLOAD[Payload Schema&lt;br/&gt;JSON Schema / Avro / Protobuf]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>OpenAPI 等价物</th>\n<th>AsyncAPI 含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Server</td>\n<td>Server</td>\n<td>消息代理连接信息（broker URL、协议、认证）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Channel</td>\n<td>Path</td>\n<td>消息通道（Kafka Topic、NATS Subject、AMQP Queue）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Operation</td>\n<td>Operation (GET/POST)</td>\n<td>消息操作（send = 你发布；receive = 你消费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Message</td>\n<td>Request/Response Body</td>\n<td>消息格式（headers + payload）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bindings</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>协议特定配置（Kafka partition key、MQTT QoS）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"asyncapi-3-x-规范结构\">AsyncAPI 3.x 规范结构</h2><h3 id=\"基础文档示例\">基础文档示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"asyncapi: 3.1.0&#10;info:&#10;  title: Order Events API&#10;  version: 2.0.0&#10;  description: 订单领域的事件发布与消费契约&#10;servers:&#10;  production:&#10;    host: kafka.internal:9092&#10;    protocol: kafka&#10;    description: 生产环境 Kafka 集群&#10;channels:&#10;  orderCreated:&#10;    address: order.events.created&#10;    messages:&#10;      OrderCreatedMessage:&#10;        $ref: &#39;#/components/messages/OrderCreated&#39;&#10;operations:&#10;  publishOrderCreated:&#10;    action: send&#10;    channel:&#10;      $ref: &#39;#/channels/orderCreated&#39;&#10;    messages:&#10;      - $ref: &#39;#/components/messages/OrderCreated&#39;&#10;  consumeOrderCreated:&#10;    action: receive&#10;    channel:&#10;      $ref: &#39;#/channels/orderCreated&#39;&#10;    messages:&#10;      - $ref: &#39;#/components/messages/OrderCreated&#39;&#10;components:&#10;  messages:&#10;    OrderCreated:&#10;      name: OrderCreated&#10;      contentType: application/json&#10;      payload:&#10;        type: object&#10;        required: [orderId, customerId, amount, createdAt]&#10;        properties:&#10;          orderId:&#10;            type: string&#10;            format: uuid&#10;          customerId:&#10;            type: string&#10;          amount:&#10;            type: number&#10;            minimum: 0&#10;          createdAt:&#10;            type: string&#10;            format: date-time\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">asyncapi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Order Events API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">订单领域的事件发布与消费契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">servers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  production</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka.internal:9092</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">生产环境 Kafka 集群</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">channels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  orderCreated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order.events.created</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    messages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      OrderCreatedMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/messages/OrderCreated'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">operations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  publishOrderCreated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">send</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/channels/orderCreated'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    messages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">$ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/messages/OrderCreated'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  consumeOrderCreated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">receive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      $ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/channels/orderCreated'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    messages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">$ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#/components/messages/OrderCreated'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">components</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  messages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    OrderCreated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OrderCreated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      contentType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      payload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">customerId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          orderId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">uuid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          customerId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            minimum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">date-time</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"3-0-vs-2-x-的关键改进\">3.0 vs 2.x 的关键改进</h3><p>AsyncAPI 3.0（2024 年 3 月发布）相比 2.x 的核心变化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Operation 方向明确化</strong>：<code>action: send</code> 表示你的服务发布，<code>action: receive</code> 表示你的服务消费——消除了 2.x 中 <code>publish/subscribe</code> 语义歧义</li>\n<li><strong>Channel 与 Operation 解耦</strong>：同一 Channel 可定义多个 Operation，支持双向通信</li>\n<li><strong>多消息类型支持</strong>：一个 Channel 可承载多种 Message 类型</li>\n<li><strong>Traits 组合</strong>：DRY 原则，公共属性（如认证信息、通用 headers）可抽为 Trait 复用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"代码生成与工具链\">代码生成与工具链</h2><p>AsyncAPI 的价值不仅在文档——它驱动完整的工具链：</p>\n<p><strong>代码生成</strong>（AsyncAPI Generator）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从规范生成 TypeScript/Java/Go 的 Producer/Consumer 骨架代码</li>\n<li>生成消息的类型定义（TypeScript interfaces、Java POJOs）</li>\n<li>生成协议绑定配置</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>文档生成</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AsyncAPI Studio：可视化编辑器 + 实时预览</li>\n<li>生成 HTML 文档站点，自动保持与规范同步</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>验证工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>asyncapi validate</code>：校验规范文件的语法正确性</li>\n<li>契约测试：验证实际发布的消息是否符合规范定义的 Schema</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>模拟工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Microcks：基于 AsyncAPI 规范生成 Mock Producer/Consumer，支持集成测试</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"契约治理工作流\">契约治理工作流</h2><p>将 AsyncAPI 集成到 CI/CD 实现<strong>事件契约即代码（Contract as Code）</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    DEV[开发者修改事件格式]&#10;    DEV --&gt;|PR 包含 asyncapi.yaml 变更| CI[CI Pipeline]&#10;    CI --&gt;|1. asyncapi validate| VALID{语法正确?}&#10;    VALID --&gt;|No| REJECT[PR 阻断]&#10;    VALID --&gt;|Yes| COMPAT{兼容性检查}&#10;    COMPAT --&gt;|Breaking Change| REJECT&#10;    COMPAT --&gt;|Compatible| GEN[生成代码/文档]&#10;    GEN --&gt; DEPLOY[部署到 API Portal]&#10;    GEN --&gt; REG[注册到 Schema Registry]\">flowchart LR\n    DEV[开发者修改事件格式]\n    DEV --&gt;|PR 包含 asyncapi.yaml 变更| CI[CI Pipeline]\n    CI --&gt;|1. asyncapi validate| VALID{语法正确?}\n    VALID --&gt;|No| REJECT[PR 阻断]\n    VALID --&gt;|Yes| COMPAT{兼容性检查}\n    COMPAT --&gt;|Breaking Change| REJECT\n    COMPAT --&gt;|Compatible| GEN[生成代码/文档]\n    GEN --&gt; DEPLOY[部署到 API Portal]\n    GEN --&gt; REG[注册到 Schema Registry]</pre><h3 id=\"兼容性检查规则\">兼容性检查规则</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>向后兼容（非破坏性）</strong>：添加可选字段、添加新 Channel/Operation、添加新 Message</li>\n<li><strong>破坏性变更</strong>：删除必须字段、修改字段类型、删除 Channel、修改 Channel address</li>\n<li>破坏性变更必须通过版本号升级（<code>version: 2.0.0</code> → <code>3.0.0</code>）并提供迁移指南</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"事件目录-event-catalog\">事件目录（Event Catalog）</h3><p>当组织规模扩大，需要一个中心化的事件目录（Event Catalog）来回答：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有哪些事件？谁发布？谁消费？</li>\n<li>某个事件的 Schema 最新版本是什么？</li>\n<li>修改某个事件会影响哪些消费者？</li>\n</ul>\n<p>开源方案 <strong>EventCatalog</strong>（eventcatalog.dev）与 AsyncAPI 原生集成，提供事件的可视化浏览、影响分析和变更通知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"asyncapi-与-openapi-的协同\">AsyncAPI 与 OpenAPI 的协同</h2><p>真实系统中同步 API（OpenAPI）和异步 API（AsyncAPI）共存。推荐的治理策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>统一 API Portal</strong>：OpenAPI 和 AsyncAPI 文档发布到同一个开发者门户</li>\n<li><strong>共享 Schema</strong>：业务实体的 Schema 在 <code>$ref</code> 中被两者引用，避免重复定义</li>\n<li><strong>统一版本策略</strong>：同步 API 和异步 API 的版本号遵循相同的 SemVer 规则</li>\n<li><strong>关联文档</strong>：OpenAPI 的接口描述中标注「此操作会触发 XXX 事件」，反之亦然</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"生产落地建议\">生产落地建议</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>从关键事件开始</strong>：先为核心业务领域（订单、支付、用户）的事件写 AsyncAPI 规范</li>\n<li><strong>规范放代码仓库</strong>：<code>asyncapi.yaml</code> 与服务代码同仓库版本管理，随代码 PR 变更</li>\n<li><strong>CI 门禁</strong>：PR 修改 asyncapi.yaml 时自动触发验证和兼容性检查</li>\n<li><strong>渐进采纳</strong>：不需要一次性为所有事件写规范，按重要性逐步覆盖</li>\n<li><strong>Owner 明确</strong>：每个事件 Channel 在规范中标注 <code>x-owner</code> 扩展属性</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>AsyncAPI 3.1.0 是事件驱动 API 的契约标准，与 OpenAPI 同构互补</li>\n<li><code>action: send/receive</code> 消除了 2.x 的方向歧义</li>\n<li>工具链覆盖代码生成、文档生成、验证、模拟的全生命周期</li>\n<li>CI/CD 集成实现契约即代码——破坏性变更在 PR 阶段即被拦截</li>\n<li>Event Catalog 提供组织级的事件可发现性和影响分析</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../messaging/schema-registry-cloudevents\">Schema Registry 与 CloudEvents</a>：AsyncAPI 的 payload schema 通常与 Schema Registry 配合使用</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../service-mesh/operations/observability-integration\">Service Mesh 可观测性集成</a>：从网络层可观测性到应用层事件契约的治理互补</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AsyncAPI 契约治理","id":"asyncapi-契约治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AsyncAPI 3.x 规范结构","id":"asyncapi-3-x-规范结构"},{"level":3,"text":"基础文档示例","id":"基础文档示例"},{"level":3,"text":"3.0 vs 2.x 的关键改进","id":"3-0-vs-2-x-的关键改进"},{"level":2,"text":"代码生成与工具链","id":"代码生成与工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"契约治理工作流","id":"契约治理工作流"},{"level":3,"text":"兼容性检查规则","id":"兼容性检查规则"},{"level":3,"text":"事件目录（Event Catalog）","id":"事件目录-event-catalog"},{"level":2,"text":"AsyncAPI 与 OpenAPI 的协同","id":"asyncapi-与-openapi-的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"生产落地建议","id":"生产落地建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Saga 编排与事件编舞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/patterns/saga-choreography"},"next":{"title":"Event Mesh 与事件路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations/event-mesh-routing"}}